Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.69,0:02:57.19,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}弱小的棋子啊 舞动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.07,0:02:58.99,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}Zugzwang Du-Ra-ta-ta
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.99,0:03:02.78,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}在我的掌心上
