Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.91,0:23:14.99,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}不公的世界(All right)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.99,0:23:17.83,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}只要放弃就无法改变
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.83,0:23:20.88,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}不公的发展(OMG)
